-- Rifts World Book 34: Northern Gun Two, the separately priced Forester consumables and Gladius Light upgrades (printed 94-100)
-- 8 gear rows.
--
-- One-off data script, run once per environment. NOT a migration - it adds
-- rows, not schema.
--
